# Corporate groups (Wikidata P749 "parent organization", checked 2026-11-19). subsidiaryOf is
# transitive: Halo Studios -> Xbox Game Studios -> Microsoft. OWL has no time: Bungie has been
# part of Sony Interactive Entertainment only since 2022 (it made Halo: Reach in 2010).
<http://www.videogame-ontology.org/ontology#pub/Xbox_Game_Studios> vg:subsidiaryOf <http://www.videogame-ontology.org/ontology#pub/Microsoft> .
<http://www.videogame-ontology.org/ontology#dev/Halo_Studios> vg:subsidiaryOf <http://www.videogame-ontology.org/ontology#pub/Xbox_Game_Studios> .
