<http://www.videogame-ontology.org/ontology#pub/Rockstar_Games> vg:subsidiaryOf <http://www.videogame-ontology.org/ontology#pub/Take-Two_Interactive> .
<http://www.videogame-ontology.org/ontology#dev/Bioware> vg:subsidiaryOf <http://www.videogame-ontology.org/ontology#pub/Electronic_Arts> .
<http://www.videogame-ontology.org/ontology#dev/Nintendo_Entertainment_Analysis__Development> vg:subsidiaryOf <http://www.videogame-ontology.org/ontology#pub/Nintendo> .
