# Who makes each console (Wikidata P176, brand owner only: P176 also lists contract
# manufacturers such as Foxconn or Flex; for Xbox and Xbox One it lists only those, so the
# brand owner Microsoft is used). PS5's P176 is Sony Group, the other PlayStations' is SIE.
<http://www.videogame-ontology.org/ontology#platform/PlayStation> vg:manufacturedBy <http://www.videogame-ontology.org/ontology#pub/Sony_Interactive_Entertainment> .
